尺），如果你將其擺放在一個垂直表面上，且那個表面後的厚度不超過5尺，你就可以利用這個窗戶看穿那個垂直表面</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\"> 9 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.lrY5i0uWVAQx258r]{鐐銬 Manacles}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\">10 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">10張@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.B7ECFAA240FCEE11]{羊皮紙 Parchment}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\"> 3 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">3把@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.78342EC246D19CE6]{匕首 Dagger}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\"> 4 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">4瓶@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.H3MuYMhHC8ouyp2x]{燈油 Oil（扁瓶 Flask）}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\"> 5 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">5件絲制@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.6181A4793273F992]{長袍 Robes}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\"> 6 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.5777EBC9E403D996]{文書僞造工具 Forgery Kit}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\"> 7 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.F567808128333146]{長棍 Quarterstaff}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\"> 8 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.BC9960FCDA8E3435]{漁具 Fishing Tackle}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\"> 9 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">皮質@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.EHRyPCwiS8LJafQY]{裝着18GP的小包 18GP Pouch}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\">10 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">10支@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.95FAB1D8AC957844]{弩矢 Crossbow Bolt}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\"> 3 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">3本@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.A2E2F9F6ED324AFF]{書本 Book}，其中以通用語撰寫着幾項隨機的歷史事件</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\"> 4 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">帆布@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.50144CCED45B3F99]{雙人帳篷 Two-Person Tent}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\"> 5 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.C7EB8154F262B10A]{絲繩（50尺）Silk Rope (50 ft.)}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\"> 6 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">2把@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.FFtdwzxSShSFuysi]{撬棍 Crowbar}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\"> 7 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.FEB60E7C8972185B]{醫療包 Healer's Kit}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\"> 8 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">8顆價值5gp的寶石</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"23\" data-roll-max=\"23\"> 9 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.0L7uaZbCxGZnpgeB]{油燈 Lamp}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"24\" data-roll-max=\"24\">10 ♣</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.38FAF22884C04056]{鏈條（10尺）Chain (10 feet)}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"25\" data-roll-max=\"25\"> 3 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">3根@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.8D4EB908E928B7A5]{矛 Spear}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"26\" data-roll-max=\"26\"> 4 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.lwFoWeDxKjtbjrBQ]{鋼面鏡 Steel Mirror}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"27\" data-roll-max=\"27\"> 5 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">15尺長的木杆</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"28\" data-roll-max=\"28\"> 6 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">麻制@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.FD4EAEEDEA14F1A4]{大袋子 Sack}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"29\" data-roll-max=\"29\"> 7 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">2套@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.191986051F42D84B]{高檔服裝 Fine Clothes}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"30\" data-roll-max=\"30\"> 8 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.818E7159858CB886]{鏟子 Shovel}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"31\" data-roll-max=\"31\"> 9 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.6007BDFC48583052]{輕錘 Light Hammer}</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"32\" data-roll-max=\"32\">10 ♠</td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">10支@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.itempack.Item.CF71E50BD1C63428]{箭 Arrow}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每張牌的正面都各有着一個不同物品或物品組的插圖。以一個動作，你可以從牌組中選擇一張卡，將其抽出並將其扔到你周圍5尺範圍內的空地上。當卡牌落地後，卡牌將永久轉化爲其正面所描繪的物品或物品組。你可以用一套修改過的現實世界牌組模擬這套牌組，如雜燴牌組表所示的那樣。</p><p>This wooden box contains a set of thirty-two parchment cards.</p><table class=\"w-100 rd__table  stripe-odd-table\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Miscellany\"><caption>Deck of Miscellany</caption><thead><tr><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-rd-isroller=\"true\">[[/r 1d32]]{Card}</th><th class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \" data-rd-isroller=\"false\">Item</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\"> 3 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Wooden @item[abacus|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\"> 4 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Four @item[Perfume (vial)|PHB|vials of perfume]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\"> 5 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">5 days' worth of @item[Rations (1 day)|PHB|rations]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\"> 6 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@item[Iron pot|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\"> 7 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@item[Disguise kit|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\"> 8 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Window (up to 5 feet wide and 5 feet high), which you can place on a vertical surface up to 5 feet thick and which allows you to look through the surface</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\"> 9 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@item[Manacles|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\">10 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Ten @item[Parchment (one sheet)|PHB|sheets of parchment]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\"> 3 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Three @item[dagger|PHB|daggers]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\"> 4 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Four @item[Oil (flask)|PHB|flasks of oil]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\"> 5 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">Five silk @item[robes|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\"> 6 <span class=\"rd__color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-10 \">@item[Forgery kit|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rd__th ve-col-2 ve-text-center \" data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\